Assertions:
[STATUS] HTTP 302 returned for the unauthenticated request — access IS denied; this platform redirects anonymous API callers to the login page rather than returning 401 {OBSERVED} (verified live 2026-07-30; the previous "401" expectation never matched this platform)
[STATUS] the response is NOT 2xx — the endpoint must never serve an unauthenticated caller {SPEC} (AC5 RBAC)
[STATE] no OrganizationMembership row is created by the unauthenticated call {SPEC}

